@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
title AFTER MVP — Proposed — Conditional event creation and attendee response
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Owner
participant "Calendar owner" as C
participant "Provider adapter" as A
participant Provider as P
actor Attendee
Owner -> C : explicitly publish selected local activity
C -> C : current calendar authority, exact version and intent identity
alt invitation behavior actually sourced and supported
 C -> A : reviewed event / attendee intent
 A -> P : actual permitted create / update
 P --> A : event identity / actual outcome or uncertainty
 A --> C : attributable mapping evidence
 P --> Attendee : invitation if actual provider behavior enables it
 Attendee -> P : response through actually supported route
 C -> A : observe permitted event / attendee state
 A --> C : response observation + freshness, if available
else capability not established
 C --> Owner : local activity or explicit unavailable response; no invented invite
end

@enduml
